* Process:      0.11 um Logic and Mixed-Mode Metal Metal Capacitor Al Enhancement Process 
* Device Type:  n-ch and p-ch MOSFET  
* Description:  1.2V
* Model:        BSIM3 3.24
* Simulator:    HSPICE
* Model Version:1.0 P4
* Model features:
*     Global model:  Yes
*     Igate model:  Yes
*     Flicker Noise: Yes
*     LOD model: Yes
*     RF model: No
*     Well proximity effect: No
********************************************************************************								
* Revision history:																	
* <Revision 1>																	
* Version : 0.1 p1																	
* Date    : 2010 / 01 / 08																	
* Author  : Jian Zhi Huang																	
* Remark  : 1. Copy model form l110e_hs12_v021_target.lib in the G-05-LOGIC/MIXED_MODE11-MMC/L110E-SPICE. 																	
*           2. New DSM version definition from 2009/11/30.																	
*           3. Align L110AE shrink methodology. Change Xl from 12nm to 8nm.																	
*  
* <Revision 2>                  
* Version : 0.1 p2                  
* Date    : 2010 / 04 / 13                  
* Author  : Ho Cheng Hu
* Remark  : 1. Update Idlin corenr aligned to Idsat.
* 
* <Revision 3>                  
* Version : 0.2 p1                  
* Date    : 2010 / 05 / 11                  
* Author  : Kelly Pao
* Remark  : 1. The model had been passed the verification of new silicon data .
*
* <Revision 4>                  
* Version : 0.2 p2                  
* Date    : 2010 / 08 / 11                  
* Author  : Shih-Hsin Yeh
* Remark  : 1. Remove the typo in the model card.
*	    2. Copy Igate model from L110E model.
*
* <Revision 5>                  
* Version : 0.3 P1                 
* Date    : 2010 / 10 / 22                 
* Author  : Kelly Pao
* Remark  : 1. Removed the m in igate area formula.(area='w*0.9*l*0.9*m*1e4*tcig' --> area='w*0.9*l*0.9*1e4*tcig')
*	          2. Updated the wmax,lmax
*
* <Revision 6>                  
* Version : 0.4 P1                 
* Date    : 2010 / 10 / 28                 
* Author  : Yealing Lin
* Remark  : 1. Add Twell NMOS model (copy from Twin well NMOS).
*           2. Modify Igate model:
*              (a) m=m to m=1
*              (b) area='w*0.9*l*0.9*1e4*tcig'to area='w*0.9*(l*0.9+8e-9)*1e4*tcig'
*              <c) 'rsh*nrd/m' to 'rsh*nrd'
*              <d) 'rsh*nrs/m' to 'rsh*nrd'
*
* <Revision 7>  
* Version : 0.5 P1
* Date    : 20010/12/24
* Author  : YZ wang
* Remark  : 1. Revised the target values (10um/0.116um) based on EDR revision.
*           2. Add the enhancement of thermal noise model
*           3. Triple well NMOS model was copied from twin well NMOS model.
*
* <Revision 8>                   
* Version : 1.0_p1                   
* Date    : 2012 /09 / 14                  
* Author  : Laney Fan 
* Remark  : 1. Version up to 1.0 based on 6 pcs Si data.
* 
* <Revision 9>                   
* Version : 1.0_p2                  
* Date    : 2013 /04 /15                  
* Author  : YZ Wang 
* Remark  : 1. Modify the Verilog-A file.
*
* <Revision 10>                   
